name 'csaif_pl_ai_02-rev-01_v2'
title 'Redundancy'
description ''
question 'What does redundancy mean in a network?'

wrong 'Having a single path for messages to travel.'
right  'Having backup paths so data can still reach its destination if one path fails.'
wrong 'Sending the same message multiple times to make sure it arrives.'
wrong 'Deleting unnecessary routers from the network to improve speed.'
allow_multiple_attempts true